detaileddescription.para:
Sets the calling thread's stream capture interaction mode to the value contained in *mode, and overwrites *mode with the previous mode for the thread. To facilitate deterministic behavior across function or module boundaries, callers are encouraged to use this API in a push-pop fashion:cudaStreamCaptureModemode=desiredMode;
cudaThreadExchangeStreamCaptureMode(&mode);
...
cudaThreadExchangeStreamCaptureMode(&mode);//restorepreviousmode
